<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia revised Jan inflation 9 pct y/y vs 8.8 pc.</title>
<headline>Slovenia revised Jan inflation 9 pct y/y vs 8.8 pc.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office on Friday released the following revisions to January preliminary consumer prices.</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p>    (changes in percent)	 Jan	  Dec   Jan96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	1.1 (1.0)  0.7    1.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  9.0 (8.9)  8.8    8.5</p>
<p>NOTE - previously reported preliminary data in brackets -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
